   "html": "<section class=\"block card xpulse-card\"><h2>X analyst pulse <span class=\"tag\">X · Oct 29</span></h2><div class=\"xp-verdict warn\"><div class=\"xp-verdict-main\"><span class=\"xp-verdict-lbl\">Crowd read</span><span class=\"xp-verdict-txt\">Analysts lean <strong>cautious</strong></span></div><div class=\"xp-verdict-meta\"><span class=\"xp-count pos\">1 bullish</span><span class=\"xp-count warn\">3 neutral</span><span class=\"xp-count neg\">1 bearish</span><span class=\"src-chip agree\">Agrees with our Cautious regime</span></div></div><ul class=\"xp-list\"><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2115557792484343881\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2115557792484343881.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Short-term holders' average profit has shrunk to 5.5% from 20% a month ago.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2115557792484343881\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 29</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2115557792484343881\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2115465993535562158\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @ecoinometrics\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2115465993535562158.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">macro</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Across 81 Fed meetings, Bitcoin's median return a week after a cut, hold or hike is close to zero.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2115465993535562158\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@ecoinometrics</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 28</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2115465993535562158\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2115372020896510284\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2115372020896510284.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Binance has seen about $2 billion of net stablecoin outflows in October, the largest since July.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2115372020896510284\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 28</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2115372020896510284\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2115429503237599615\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @glassnode\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2115429503237599615.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Long-term holders sit on coins bought above $85K and each dip brings smaller losses, while altcoin breadth is fading.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2115429503237599615\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@glassnode</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 28</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2115429503237599615\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/caprioleio/status/2114525099772752339\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @caprioleio\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2114525099772752339.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig pos\">Bullish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">derivatives</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Bitcoin's put/call ratio has reached an extreme that has historically come with relatively capped local downside.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/caprioleio/status/2114525099772752339\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@caprioleio</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 26</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/caprioleio/status/2114525099772752339\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
